{"id": "EUVD-2026-97878", "enisaUuid": "4e6c84b0-b9c8-3e66-9f17-1d0195d09af8", "description": "modern-tar 0.3.5 through 0.8.5 contains a memory exhaustion vulnerability that allows attackers to produce negative entry sizes via non-octal bytes parsed by readOctal(). Attackers can supply a crafted, optionally gzip-compressed, archive to unpackTar() that buffers chunks indefinitely, exhausting process memory and suppressing later entries.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T20:55:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:40:11", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/ayuhito/modern-tar/pull/195", "https://github.com/ayuhito/modern-tar/commit/181c8cb75351867535057817ada4802a90fe416e", "https://github.com/ayuhito/modern-tar/blob/v0.8.5/src/tar/encoding.ts", "https://github.com/ayuhito/modern-tar", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/modern-tar-0.3.5-through-0.8.5-memory-exhaustion-via-malformed-octal-size-field"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109380", "GHSA-m6wr-6wgx-82mm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.45, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d9a9c7f2-a3fb-39aa-a1ec-d4cb36cdbc58", "product": {"name": "modern-tar", "vendor": {"name": "ayuhito"}}, "product_version": "0.3.5 \u22640.8.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c9da24c2-2ec8-3a90-9e1f-810280c24ba4", "vendor": {"name": "ayuhito"}}], "isExploited": false}